  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two containers, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>, are filled with an ideal gas at the same pressure.</p>\n<p>The volume of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> is four times the volume of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>. The temperature of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> is 327 °C and the temperature of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> is 27 °C.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{amount of substance in X}}{\\textit{amount of substance in Y}}\"></span> ?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{8}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
